sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller
    participant Edge as Trust Edge
    participant Control as Tenant Control Plane
    participant Provider as Provider Service
    participant Resource as Tenant Resource
    participant Evidence as Evidence and Telemetry

    Caller->>Edge: Authenticate and request tenant operation
    Edge->>Control: Resolve tenant, membership, property, and lifecycle
    Control-->>Edge: Validated scope, policy, entitlement, and placement

    alt Missing, conflicting, or unauthorized scope
        Edge-->>Caller: Deny without resource disclosure
        Edge->>Evidence: Record denied context decision
    else Trusted tenant context established
        Edge->>Provider: Call with bounded context and correlation
        Provider->>Control: Revalidate policy or current state as required
        Control-->>Provider: Decision and authoritative references
        Provider->>Provider: Validate resource tenant and property ownership

        alt Ownership or authority mismatch
            Provider-->>Caller: Deny with stable tenant-safe error
            Provider->>Evidence: Record mismatch and security signal
        else Operation permitted
            Provider->>Resource: Execute in approved tenant placement
            Resource-->>Provider: Tenant-bound result
            Provider->>Evidence: Emit scoped telemetry, audit, event, and usage
            Provider-->>Caller: Return tenant-bound response
        end
    end
